<p>Details: ${inc_desc_circumens} ${refusal_reason} ${hv_indiv_inv_des}</p>
<p>Please open the following <a href="${mail_script:x_hccc_hoc_ohs_inv_case_link}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">link</a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Thank you,</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<div>
<p><strong>Occupational Health and Safety</strong></p>
<p>House of Commons</p>
<p>50 O&rsquo;Connor, 8<span data-fontsize="11">th</span> floor <br />Ottawa, Ontario, K1A 0A6</p>
